      "reason": "Backtrader's default RSI indicator already uses the modified/Wilder smoothed moving average internally, which is exactly the 'standard Wilder's RSI formula with smoothing' the spec requires."
    },
    {
      "topic": "entry_signal_definition",
      "choice": "Interpreted 'RSI falls below 30 then rises back above 30' (and symmetrically for 70) as the single-bar crossover of the level: rsi[-1] below the level and rsi[0] back on/above it",
      "reason": "This is the standard, unambiguous reading of a 'leaves the zone' signal; the spec gives no separate lookback window for how long RSI must stay in the zone first."
    },
    {
      "topic": "trend_confirmation_clause",
